; editors/emacs: mini-emacs (docs/plans/plan_emacs.md), an Emacs
; written after efuns: core/ and features/ as efuns' src/, here its
; configuration (Config: the keys and the modes; Config_pad: the
; author's own, over it; Start: the editor made, for a host), and
; the hosts' programs: tty/ a terminal, sdl/ a window on Linux, draw/
; one of mini-rio's under mini-9pi (lib_terminal/hosts's).
(library
 (name ix_emacs)
 (wrapped false)
 (modules Config Config_pad Start)
 (libraries ix_emacs_modes ix_emacs_features ix_emacs_core ix_code ix_terminal))
